<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>A priest I long to be,</l><l>One who is always coming</l><l>And spending time with Thee.</l><l>Thy face I’d seek each day, Lord,</l><l>And in Thy presence stay.</l><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>Oh, fill me, Lord, I pray!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>A prophet I would be,</l><l>One who is always speaking</l><l>The things I hear from Thee.</l><l>Thine every word I’d treasure,</l><l>And live on what You say;</l><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>Thy word I will convey!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>A man of prayer I’d be;</l><l>I would not cease my praying</l><l>And sin, O Lord, ’gainst Thee.</l><l>“Age-turning” prayers are needed;</l><l>I’ll pray: “Thy will be done.”</l><l>Speak Lord, Thy servant’s listening.</l><l>Oh, may Thy kingdom come!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
